{"parse":{"title":"个性/真爱庇护","pageid":9106,"revid":22278,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%9C%9F%E7%88%B1%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%9C%9F%E7%88%B1%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%9C%9F%E7%88%B1%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>真爱庇护</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.9C.9F.E7.88.B1.E5.BA.87.E6.8A.A4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"真爱庇护\"><b>真爱庇护</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 真爱庇护.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0c/d00nvrt242nsj9hwq98sdtpdcn5i1uw.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%9C%9F%E7%88%B1%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0c/d00nvrt242nsj9hwq98sdtpdcn5i1uw.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%9C%9F%E7%88%B1%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0c/d00nvrt242nsj9hwq98sdtpdcn5i1uw.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />真爱庇护\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">初月庇护</font></span>]。战斗开始时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"坚定信仰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">坚定信仰</font></span></span>]。主动治疗后，驱散目标己方随机1个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，使其获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"防御加护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">防御加护</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦拥有特定[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值加成•sp卡丽丝\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虔诚值加成•sp卡丽丝</font></span></span>]，且[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加时，并获得对应层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"卡丽丝的救赎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">卡丽丝的救赎</font></span></span>]。<br />✦最大生命值、治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">10%</font>。行动开始时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">20</font>点。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8D%A1%E4%B8%BD%E4%B8%9D%E2%80%A2%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4%E4%B9%8B%E8%AA%93\" title=\"角色图鉴库/卡丽丝•庇护之誓\"><img alt=\"头像 卡丽丝•庇护之誓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/34/ax9hkbxkda6nbp2vlg6wqo4n55fe2ct.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">卡丽丝•庇护之誓</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">初月庇护</font></span>]。战斗开始时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"坚定信仰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">坚定信仰</font></span></span>]。主动治疗后，驱散目标己方随机1个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，使其获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"防御加护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">防御加护</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦拥有特定[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值加成•sp卡丽丝\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虔诚值加成•sp卡丽丝</font></span></span>]，且[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加时，并获得对应层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"卡丽丝的救赎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">卡丽丝的救赎</font></span></span>]。<br />✦最大生命值、治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">20%</font>。行动开始时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">20</font>点。每回合首次受到治疗时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">初月庇护</font></span>]。战斗开始时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"坚定信仰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">坚定信仰</font></span></span>]。主动治疗后，驱散目标己方随机1个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，使其获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"防御加护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">防御加护</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦拥有特定[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值加成•sp卡丽丝\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虔诚值加成•sp卡丽丝</font></span></span>]，且[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加时，并获得对应层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"卡丽丝的救赎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">卡丽丝的救赎</font></span></span>]。<br />✦最大生命值、治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">20%</font>。行动开始时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">30</font>点。每回合首次受到治疗时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">初月庇护</font></span>]中获得效果改为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"庇护之力2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">庇护之力2</font></span></span>]。<br />✦受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\