救赎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">卡丽丝的救赎</font></span></span>]。<br />✦最大生命值、治疗效果提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>。行动开始时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">30</font>点。每回合首次受到治疗时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">初月庇护</font></span>]中获得效果改为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"庇护之力2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">庇护之力2</font></span></span>]。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"庇护之力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">庇护之力</font></span></span>]系列的已方，额外拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"潜能激发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">潜能激发</font></span></span>]。<br />✦受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"极度虚弱\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">极度虚弱</font></span></span>]时持续时间降至<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性五星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">初月庇护</font></span>